    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>Captains log: User Guide</label><div><h5>Captains log: Overview</h5><ul><li>Captains log: Start page with search, favorites, to-do, notes, weather, news.</li><li>Captains log: All local: data stays in your browser (localStorage).</li></ul><h5>Captains log: Shortcuts</h5><ul><li>Captains log: Ctrl/Cmd+K: open command palette</li><li>Captains log: 1-9: open first 9 favorites (when not typing)</li><li>Captains log: / : focus search (also via palette)</li><li>Captains log: Enter in search: start search</li><li>Captains log: ESC: close modals</li><li>Captains log: Palette: quick actions for widgets, theme, background, data, favorites</li><li>Captains log: Palette: key C switches card style, \"Reset header colors\" resets search & clock</li></ul><h5>Captains log: Search & Autocomplete</h5><ul><li>Captains log: Bangs: !gCaptains log:  !ddgCaptains log:  !bingCaptains log:  !ytCaptains log:  !wikiCaptains log:  !maps</li><li>Captains log: Custom shortcuts: JSON in settings; {q}Captains log:  as placeholder</li><li>Captains log: Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent searches, wordlist (global + preset)</li><li>Captains log: Tab accepts suggestion, Enter starts search</li></ul><h5>Captains log: Tiles</h5><ul><li>Captains log: Drag & drop to sort, click to open</li><li>Captains log: + Tile: add a new favorite</li><li>Captains log: Reset: restore default favorites</li></ul><h5>Captains log: Widgets & Layout</h5><ul><li>Captains log: Visibility per widget</li><li>Captains log: Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal)</li><li>Captains log: Custom colors for clock/search; reset restores style defaults</li><li>Captains log: Widget colors & \"Tint widgets\" set the accent per card</li></ul><h5>Captains log: Background</h5><ul><li>Captains log: Presets, uploads, collections, rotation (time/theme/interval)</li><li>Captains log: Accent color is extracted from the active background</li></ul><h5>Captains log: Data</h5><ul